<p>    Issuer		: Cooper Hospital/University Medical</p>
<p>Center-Camden Co. Imp. Auth.</p>
<p>    State		 : NJ</p>
<p>    Rating		: Baa2</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 71,020,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 02/06/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
